  "bodyHash": "3RFTF2evu2Y=",
  "content": "<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1028108/description_f4c37d87-7a29-47eb-a04f-9374e71e3af7.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"800\" height=\"600\"></p><hr><h1 style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"color:#c2e0f4;font-size:36px\"><em><strong>最沉浸的Minecraft FPS體驗</strong></em></span></h1><ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:18px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#f1c40f\"><strong>3A級槍戰與視覺效果</strong></span> - 精緻的<span style=\"color:#2dc26b\"><strong>射擊</strong>、<strong>移動</strong></span>和<span style=\"color:#2dc26b\"><strong>檢視</strong></span>動畫</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:18px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#f1c40f\"><strong>設計完善的槍械製造系統</strong></span> - <span style=\"color:#2dc26b\"><strong>用配件改裝你的槍械</strong></span>，生存模式友好！</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:18px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#f1c40f\"><strong>精緻模型與優化</strong></span> - <span style=\"color:#2dc26b\"><strong>LOD優化</strong></span>策略</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:18px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#f1c40f\"><strong>相容性</strong></span> - <span style=\"color:#2dc26b\"><strong>相容大部分光影</strong></span>，安心遊玩！</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:18px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#f1c40f\"><strong>可自訂</strong></span> - 透過設定檔和JSON<span style=\"color:#2dc26b\"><strong>自由自訂槍械資料</strong></span>！（需安裝<span style=\"color:#0ff\"> <strong><a style=\"color:#0ff\" href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/cloth-config\" rel=\"nofollow\">Cloth Config</a></strong></span>）</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:18px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#f1c40f\"><strong>成為創作者</strong></span> - 無需程式碼即可建立你的<span style=\"color:#2dc26b\"><strong>槍械包</strong></span>！</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:18px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#f1c40f\"><strong>FPS優化</strong></span> - <span style=\"color:#2dc26b\"><strong>相容 <span style=\"color:#0ff\"><a style=\"color:#0ff\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/accelerated-rendering\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Accelerated Rendering</a></span></strong></span> 模組以提升FPS效能！</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:18px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#f1c40f\"><strong>生動的第三人稱動畫</strong></span> - <span style=\"color:#2dc26b\"><strong>使用 <span style=\"color:#0ff\"><a style=\"color:#0ff\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/playeranimator\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Player Animator</a></span> </strong><span style=\"color:#95a5a6\">以實現第三人稱動畫</span></span></span></li>\n</ul><p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:18px;color:#7e8c8d\"><strong><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">TaCZ 由重組的原 TaC 開發團隊開發，完全重寫了所有程式碼，重新製作了模型和動畫，並新增和修改了許多功能。</span></strong></span></p><h2 style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#2dc26b;font-size:36px;font-family:&amp;#x27\">1.20.1 版本現已支援！</span></h2><hr><h1 style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#6b43dc\"><strong>Discord</strong></span></h1><p style=\"text-align:center\">我們強烈建議你加入我們的 Discord 伺服器，以獲取模組更新的最新資訊。</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://discord.gg/ykPDSvR4Mz\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1028108/description_3425715f-70cf-428a-9b1e-9af51cf012a7.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"191\" height=\"76\"></a><br><span style=\"color:#3598db\"><a style=\"color:#3598db\" href=\"https://discord.gg/ykPDSvR4Mz\" rel=\"nofollow\">點選這裡或點選圖片</a></span></p><hr><p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;<span style=\"font-family:&amp;#x27;font-size:36px;color:#f60\"><strong>&nbsp;<em>功能特色</em></strong></span></p><div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><span style=\"color:#fff\"><em><strong><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://s2.loli.net/2024/05/31/ILUHAr4dlNKJOvE.gif\" width=\"441\" height=\"247\"></strong></em></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#fff\"><em><strong><span style=\"font-size:18px\">獨特的裝填與檢視動畫 - 每把槍都與眾不同！</span></strong></em></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#fff\"><em><strong><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1028108/description_995abbaa-ae11-451d-b80c-430c005a352c.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"434\" height=\"160\"></span></span></strong></em></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#fff\"><em><strong><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\">透過全新的配件UI改裝你的武器</span></span></span></strong></em></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#fff\"><em><strong><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1028108/description_07b26c1c-29ad-4fc3-89f2-7ffbaef0286a.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"284\" height=\"212\"></span></span></span></span></strong></em></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#fff\"><em><strong><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\">在專屬工作台中製作 - 生存模式友好</span></span></span></span></span></strong></em></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#fff\"><em><strong><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fsm.ms%252fimage%252ftzLwhK238vXTib6\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://s2.loli.net/2024/05/31/tzLwhK238vXTib6.gif\" alt=\"javaw.exe 2024.05.31 - 01.01.09.08.gif\" width=\"296\" height=\"166\"></a></span></span></span></span></span></strong></em></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#fff\"><em><strong><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\">同時實現視覺化與相容性 - 全新的瞄準鏡視角實現</span></span></span></span></span></strong></em></span></p>\n</div><hr><h3 style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:36px;color:#e03e2d\"><em><strong>一周年紀念預告片</strong></em></span></h3><div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><span><span><iframe style=\"width:600px;display:table;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/Gp8jm7r_XZE\" width=\"600\" height=\"364\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></p>\n</div><hr><h1 style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"color:#e67e23\"><strong>安裝說明</strong></span></h1><h2><span style=\"color:#2dc26b\"><span style=\"color:#e03e2d\"><span style=\"color:#f1c40f\"><span style=\"color:#2dc26b\"><span style=\"color:#ced4d9\">需求（Forge）：</span></span><strong><span style=\"color:#2dc26b\"> </span><span style=\"color:#2dc26b\">無需安裝強制模組！</span></strong></span></span></span></h2><h1><span style=\"color:#ced4d9\"><strong>推薦安裝：</strong></span></h1><p><span style=\"color:#0ff\"><a style=\"color:#0ff\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/playeranimator\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">[下載] Player Animator </a></span> : <span style=\"color:#95a5a6\">改善第三人稱動畫</span> <span style=\"color:#f1c40f\"><span style=\"color:#ced4d9\"> </span>( <span style=\"color:#2dc26b\"><strong>強烈推薦！</strong></span> )</span></p><p><span style=\"color:#0ff\"><a style=\"color:#0ff\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/accelerated-rendering\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">[下載] Accelerated Rendering</a> : <span style=\"color:#95a5a6\">提升FPS效能</span>&nbsp;<span style=\"color:#f1c40f\"><span style=\"color:#ced4d9\"> </span>( <span style=\"color:#2dc26b\"><strong>強烈推薦！</strong></span> )</span></span></p><p><span style=\"color:#0ff\"><a style=\"color:#0ff\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/oculus\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">[下載] Oculus&nbsp;</a></span> : 最佳化模組以獲得更好的相容性</p><p>&nbsp;</p><hr><h1 style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"color:#e67e23\"><strong>官方槍械包</strong></span></h1><h3><strong>安裝方式：（<span style=\"color:#e03e2d\">1.0.3 發行版及更早版本</span>）</strong></h3><p>開啟 .minecraft 資料夾，進入 \"<span style=\"color:#e03e2d\">config/tacz/custom</span>\"，將 .zip 檔案放入其中（無需解壓縮），即可開始遊玩。如果無效，請在遊戲中嘗試指令 \"/tacz reload\"。</p><h3><strong>安裝方式：（<span style=\"color:#2dc26b\">1.1.4 發行版及更新版本</span>）</strong></h3><p>開啟你的遊戲版本資料夾，進入 \"<span style=\"color:#2dc26b\">.minecraft/tacz</span>\"，將 .zip 檔案放入其中（無需解壓縮），即可開始遊玩。如果無效，請在遊戲中嘗試指令 \"/tacz reload\" 或指令 \"/reload\"。</p><h3><strong>注意：</strong></h3><p>遊戲內的自動轉換系統將不適用於非標準的槍械包。如果你無法轉換你的槍械包，請等待該槍械包的作者更新至 1.1.4 版本，而不是聯繫我們。</p><h2><span style=\"color:#0ff\"><strong><a style=\"color:#0ff\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/customization/tacz-cyber-armorer\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">[下載] Cyber Armorer</a></strong></span></h2><p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/customization/tacz-cyber-armorer\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"color:#2dc26b\"><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1028108/description_bb3614c1-a77d-4534-bf65-f2023640c48a.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"396\" height=\"223\"></strong></span></a></p><h2><span style=\"color:#0ff\"><strong><a style=\"color:#0ff\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/customization/tacz-create-armorer-koei\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">[下載] Create Armorer</a></strong></span></h2><p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/customization/tacz-create-armorer-koei\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong><span style=\"color:#f1c40f\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1028108/description_4c50074d-2f55-489d-86a5-bef692655b71.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"398\" height=\"224\"></span></strong></a></p><h2><span style=\"color:#0ff\"><strong><a style=\"color:#0ff\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/customization/tacz-applied-armorer-koei\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">[下載] Applied Armorer</a></strong></span></h2><p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/customization/tacz-applied-armorer-koei\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"color:#2dc26b\"><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1028108/description_313aaa47-35bd-4698-b588-621548ea2e9e.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"395\" height=\"222\"></strong></span></a></p><h2><span style=\"color:#0ff\"><strong><a style=\"color:#0ff\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/customization/tacz-immersive-armorer-koei\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">[下載] Immersive Armorer</a></strong></span></h2><p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/customization/tacz-immersive-armorer-koei\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"color:#f1c40f\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1028108/description_1b2b010c-be5a-4313-935e-63209f2502a3.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"392\" height=\"294\"></span></a></p><p>&nbsp;</p><hr><h2><span style=\"color:#e67e23\"><strong>支持我們</strong></span></h2><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:18px;font-family:&amp;#x27;color:#e67e23\"><strong>↓↓↓ 點選這裡（全球） ↓↓↓</strong></span>[![](<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fi.imgur.com%252f0VuqRck.png\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://i.imgur.com/0VuqRck.png</a>)](<a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/NekoCrane\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://www.patreon.com/NekoCrane</a>)</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#b96ad9\"><strong><span style=\"font-size:18px;font-family:&amp;#x27\">↓↓↓ 點選這裡（中國） ↓↓↓</span></strong></span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\">[<span style=\"color:#000\"><strong><span style=\"font-size:18px;font-family:&amp;#x27\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1028108/description_ecd5707f-8a0d-4b69-b75b-ed3107aa150b.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"126\" height=\"126\"></span></strong></span>](<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fafdian.net%252fa%252fnekocrane\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://afdian.net/a/nekocrane</a>)</p><p>&nbsp;</p><hr><h2><span style=\"color:#e67e23\"><strong>相關連結</strong></span></h2><p><span style=\"font-size:18px;color:#ced4d9\"><strong>相關模組/資源包：</strong></span></p><ul>\n<li><span style=\"color:#3598db\">[<a style=\"color:#3598db\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fyes-steve-model\" rel=\"nofollow\">Yes Steve Model</a>]</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color:#3598db\"><a style=\"color:#3598db\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/hit-feedback\" rel=\"nofollow\">[Hit Feedback</a>]</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color:#3598db\">[<a style=\"color:#3598db\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/third-person-shooting\" rel=\"nofollow\">更好的第三人稱射擊</a>]</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color:#3598db\">[<a style=\"color:#3598db\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/tacz-lesraisins-tactical-equipements\" rel=\"nofollow\">LesRaisins 戰術裝備</a>]<br></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color:#3598db\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/tacz-gucci-vuitton-attachments\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">[Gucci &amp; Vuitton 配件]</a></span></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/tacz-fallout-gunpack\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"color:#3598db\">[Fallout 槍械包]</span></a></li>\n<li><span style=\"color:#3598db\">[<a style=\"color:#3598db\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/timeless-and-classics-guns-lesraisins-append-pack\" rel=\"nofollow\">LesRaisins 附加包</a>]</span></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/tac-sprint-tacz-edition\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">[<strong>TAC SPRINT</strong>]</a></li>\n</ul><hr><h2><span style=\"color:#e67e23\"><strong>社群槍械包</strong></span></h2><ul>\n<li>\n<p><span style=\"color:#169179\"><strong>你需要按照說明安裝槍械包，它們不是模組！</strong></span></p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;<img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1028108/description_f31a878a-1f73-4cbc-bd12-55ee4be14d74.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"271\" height=\"271\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#3598db\">[<a style=\"color:#3598db\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/customization/tacz-helldivers2-gunpack-by-koei\" rel=\"nofollow\">地獄潛者槍械包</a>]</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#353edb\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://imgur.com/WLzBAwh.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"297\" height=\"167\"></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#3598db\">[<a style=\"color:#3598db\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/customization/tacz-gucci-attachments-by-koei\" rel=\"nofollow\">Gucci 配件包</a>]</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://imgur.com/HPUvsgU.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"293\" height=\"163\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#3598db\">[<a style=\"color:#3598db\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/customization/tacz-tti-gunpack-by-koei\" rel=\"nofollow\">TTI 槍械包</a>]</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#353edb\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_5046b882-768d-4b78-afc9-4078fa6f1d71.png\" width=\"311\" height=\"175\"></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#3598db\">[<a style=\"color:#3598db\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/customization/tacz-the-division-gunpack\" rel=\"nofollow\">全境封鎖槍械包</a>]</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1028108/description_8f4fcb60-c223-46d2-9edb-17a7f95ba025.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"299\" height=\"201\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#3598db\">[<a style=\"color:#3598db\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/customization/tacz-arip-attachments-pack\" rel=\"nofollow\">ARIP 配件包</a>]</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#353edb\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1028108/description_34068921-5184-4c9b-b6ef-7df7cc8e2111.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"296\" height=\"182\"></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#3598db\"><a style=\"color:#3598db\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/customization/tacz-emx-arms-gunpack\" rel=\"nofollow\">[EMX-Arms 槍械包]</a></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1028108/description_0a89370c-14ff-4c33-a32f-90c8fcbb7bde.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"437\" height=\"169\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#3598db\">[<a style=\"color:#3598db\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/customization/tacz-xiaomantou-gunpack\" rel=\"nofollow\">小饅頭槍械包</a>]</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1028108/description_768fe8db-a949-41bb-9f6f-33c92afc5d9c.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"256\" height=\"256\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#3598db\"><a style=\"color:#3598db\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/customization/tacz-sanzu-no-kawa-gunpack\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">[三途川槍械包]</a></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#3598db\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1028108/description_db19a025-4343-4402-880a-349070dc5992.jpeg\" alt=\"\" width=\"272\" height=\"181\"></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/customization/tacz-charge-into-battle-pack\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"