108/description_962590db-7693-4fac-8081-1c7652424b5a.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"256\" height=\"256\"></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/fibers-guns-pack-for-tacz\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"color:#3598db\">[Fiber 的槍械包]</span></a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1028108/description_a3317ffa-864a-433b-8c21-ac166dcb0fef.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"312\" height=\"194\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/minecraft/customization/tacz-the-old-gun-append-pack\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"color:#3598db\">[老式槍械包]</span></a></p>\n</div>\n</li>\n</ul><hr><p><span style=\"font-size:18px;color:#008000\"><strong>Crowdin</strong></span></p><p>你可以透過 TACZ Crowdin 專案將此模組翻譯成多種語言！</p><p><span style=\"color:#3598db\"><a style=\"color:#3598db\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fcrowdin.com%252fproject%252ftacz%252finvite%253fh%253d5b1fa86261685318c0bbb77fe2f5c80a2106264\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://crowdin.com/project/tacz</a></span></p><p><span style=\"color:#e67e23\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>Wiki</strong></span></span></p><p><span style=\"color:#0ff\"><a style=\"color:#0ff\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252ftacwiki.mcma.club%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\">Timeless and Classics 模組指南 | Timeless and Classics 槍械 Wiki (mcma.club)</a></span></p><hr><h2><strong>授權</strong></h2><p>Timeless and Classics Zero 的程式碼採用 GNU GPL 3.0 授權條款，詳見 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.gnu.org%252flicenses%252fgpl-3.0.txt\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://www.gnu.org/licenses/gpl-3.0.txt</a></p><p>所有素材資源皆採用 CC BY-NC-ND 4.0 授權條款，詳見 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fcreativecommons.org%252flicenses%252fby-nc-nd%252f4.0%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-nc-nd/4.0/</a></p>",
